== Builder notes ==

* The scroll check is actually turned on and off by the [[local variable|local integer]] X2_SWITCH_ENABLE_UMD_SCROLLS on the [[module]]. The standard Hordes [[event handler|handler]] for the [[OnModuleLoad event]] (<code>x2_mod_def_load</code>, and also <code>x3_mod_def_load</code>) checks the game difficulty and sets this local variable appropriately (set to TRUE if the difficulty is at least "hardcore").
* The scroll check itself is implemented in the [[spellhook]], specifically in the [[script]] <code>x2_pc_umdcheck</code>.
